restricted-seccomp.json and the retained sharedSeccompBaseline.json fixture
derive from the effective Podman 4.9.3 zero-capability OCI seccomp policy observed
on the verification VM. The upstream containers/common profile is distributed
under the Apache License, Version 2.0:
https://github.com/containers/common/tree/v0.57.4/pkg/seccomp
https://github.com/containers/common/blob/v0.57.4/LICENSE

Modifications: retain only the native x86_64 ABI; remove multiplexed socketcall
permission; narrow socket creation to AF_INET/AF_INET6/AF_NETLINK, preserving
NETLINK_AUDIT denial; explicitly deny AF_UNIX. Default and other syscall rules
remain unchanged. The unmodified effective baseline is retained for review.

The Apache License, Version 2.0 text is adjacent in restricted-seccomp.LICENSE.
